designer_notes = "THE WOLF (Luke's H5, 2026-11-07; built 2026-11-10, HERBALISM_HUNTING_PREP.md §7 step 5): hunts in packs of 2-3 (pack_m 15 m: alerting or hitting one calls nearby wolves to join the fight, sharing the referee's attack tokens while the others circle). Its three-step string (content/kit/wolf.tres) snaps with a bite, slows with a hamstring bite, and ends with an unblockable red-glint lunge that leaps forward and pushes its target back. Slain, it leaves its carcass (content/node/wolf_carcass.tres) for wolf pelt and a rare wolf fang."
